{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"ああああ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"『MUSIC FAIR』とスペシャ\n告知してなかった..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"とっくに終わってますね..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"観てくださいましまか？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"スペシャの方はリピート放送があるので良かったです！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"『乃木坂46 5th Anniversaryスペシャル』\nリピート放送：3月31日（金）17:00～"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"『乃木坂46 ミュージックビデオスペシャル』\nも続けて観ていただけると嬉しいです"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"真夏、さゆにゃん、きいちゃん、中田\nでライブの思い出とか語ってます"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ライブに来てくださったみなさんは\n思い出しながら観れるし"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"来てなくても\nこのライブがどんな感じだったか\n知れるものになってます"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"観てなかった方は是非リピート放送で！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"先週、沈金に来てくださった\nラッパ我リヤさんの『ULTRA HARD』\n明日発売ですね～！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ラッパ我リヤさんのTwitterにも"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ちょっとだけ登場させて頂いちゃったよ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あれ実はね"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"take2です"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2017/03/28/1112190/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"うるとら を\n噛みました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"失礼致しました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2017/03/28/1112190/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"blt graph.のオフショット"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"高い所苦手なため\n手汗びっちょりの中田。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なかだかな"}],"source":"archive"}